            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Simple Podcast Manager v1.4.1

- Simplifies the main sync area so it appears only when an MP3 player is connected.
- Keeps the latest sync result aligned with the Sync button for easier scanning.
- Removes changing plan-status text that could make a successful sync look like it had failed after ejecting or reconnecting the player.
]]></description>
